{
  "id": 2,
  "description": "# End of Tradition | EST. 03/06/24\n***First Community Guild created in IMMO***\n\n\nEND is a guild that was founded toward the beginning of IMMO. We strive to create an environment that is Mature, Helpful and Friendly, while in the same aspect we are pushing to stay at the top in IMMO! \n\n### Join Requirement\n* Be active daily\n* Discord Required \n* Combat Level 92+\n\n\n### Raid Time\nMonday - Friday\n* 9AM EDT = 3 PM CEST\n\n\n### Any questions? Write to END Leadership on Discord!\n* fadeduser (User)\n* re_codes (Codes)\n* jflc (Yasa)\n* nordicwisdom (Nordic)\n* AdArtes",
